    featuredImageDescription: "Editorial hero image for Generative AI in Institutional Wealth: Eliminating Human Bias in Complex Portfolio Stress-Testing",
    keywords: ["generative AI stress testing", "institutional wealth management", "portfolio risk analysis", "cognitive bias in finance", "AI-driven scenario analysis", "Priv wealth technology"],
