    featuredImageDescription: "Editorial hero image for Departmental Efficiency Metrics: Quantifying Billable Hours Saved by Multi-Agent Legal Systems",
    keywords: ["legal department efficiency", "multi-agent systems", "billable hours automation", "legal technology ROI", "enterprise legal operations", "Brigit"],
